  "2026-10-27T18:47:17.212Z",codex-agent,"Post-merge SDK 2026.10.24 focused compatibility passes 4/4: committed legacy CAS recovery after source advancement, source-known missing-intent rebuild/unknown-source refusal, empty history and opaque revisions, and competing marker/adoption retention. Build, test typecheck, source typecheck, lint, zero duplication and 202 documented declarations pass on the merged pin; generated executable output is unchanged. Fresh read-only public-corpus validation also passes: 109 items, 205 nodes, 376 edges, 1160 admission events, one admission scan; caught-up 0 reads/0 scans/0 events, 559 JSON bytes, derived_index, 2215 ms, full equality, every authoritative filename/byte unchanged. Six packed hosts and the additional 96-boundary native matrix remain explicitly SDK 2026.10.23 evidence; CI derives current pin 2026.10.24 and reruns the complete npm/Bun release gates and native fixture. Final results/run URL will be attached to the linked PR checks/body and final handoff. Releasing this claim again; item remains unclosed. All subsequent CI verification will use the final committed head without further tracker edits."
  "2026-10-27T18:52:51.704Z",codex-agent,"Bounded CI receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-graph/actions/runs/40563477001 targets db3d9995ee2c1f44c76ced53abd57f8f8b961240. All three jobs (Node 22, Node 26 npm/Bun release gates, Windows lifecycle) remain queued with no active steps; current full-gate counts are unavailable, not zero or a pass. This final audit receipt requires a subsequent metadata-only push and fresh exact-head CI; the canonical latest run/results are recorded at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-graph/pull/175/checks and in the linked PR body. Preserve the original 19:19 UTC cutoff, rather than extending it after metadata writes. Claim is already released, item remains unclosed, runtime/tests remain unchanged, and no further tracker edits follow this receipt. Local health, changelog, history prefixes and privacy checks pass; all owned fixture processes have stopped."
  "2026-10-27T19:16:38.129Z",codex-agent,"Exact-head CI run 40564193328 passed all three jobs at 258feba: npm release 439/439, Bun release 439/439, Node 22 coverage 439/439; 99.80 percent lines, 95.84 branches, 100 functions across 29 runtime files. SDK 2026.10.24 native fixture passes all 376 boundaries (236 Blocked, 24 Closing rollbacks), 24 crash combinations, and all six packed hosts (48 foreign refusals, 24 recoveries). CI archive SHA-256 43865924f2e8f5c5e6770f85b77b0bf930a38a527b159bbaa6f837087e915831, 52 files. Log audit found one diagnostic count left at four after adding a fifth node-collision mode. The mode list now drives execution and its reported count, closing that report-drift class; all other boundary/recovery counters already derive from executed cases. Package runtime and assertions are unchanged. Focused native collision validation and static checks are running; this test-only correction will receive fresh CI, preserving the original 19:19 UTC cutoff."
  "2026-10-27T19:23:12.479Z",codex-agent,"The diagnostic correction is verified on SDK 2026.10.24: focused real Neo4j --collision-only reports five node-collision modes and one foreign-relationship collision, with original foreign properties preserved. Test typecheck, lint and zero duplication pass; no assertion or package runtime changed. Source mode collection now drives both execution and the reported count. The server stopped cleanly before the read-only cleanup probe (its connection refusal simply confirms shutdown). Passing baseline exact-head CI is https://github.com/unbraind/pm-graph/actions/runs/40564193328 at 258feba: npm 439/439, Bun 439/439, Node 22 439/439, full native matrix 376 plus 24 crash combinations and six packed hosts. This final test-report-only head needs fresh CI; its latest run and pending status will be recorded in the linked PR body and final handoff, without extending the original elapsed 19:19 UTC wait cutoff. Releasing this claim; item remains unclosed."
